mg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863420/extras/0c13ef54c01c3f61ec0d55662c896612.poster.avif?t=1754411613\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863420/extras/0c13ef54c01c3f61ec0d55662c896612.webm?t=1754411613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863420/extras/0c13ef54c01c3f61ec0d55662c896612.mp4?t=1754411613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863420/extras/ddcc4d5227ae006847238feb2b7d6c05.avif?t=1754411613\" data-has-big width=1600 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform wastelands into beautiful landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of strategy and puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance nature and colony expansion\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and calming gameplay (unless a volcano errupts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement to beat the highscore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value - every session is different with an endless amount of procedurally generated planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by great games like Islanders and Dorfromantik</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
